    "caption": "🚘 Audi unveils largest SUV with ChatGPT system\n\nAudi introduced the Q9, its biggest SUV ever, larger than the BMW X7 and Mercedes GLS. It features a media system with built-in ChatGPT and will launch in Europe from €108,000 by the end of the year.\n\nThe base model has a V6 engine with 429 hp, reaching 100 km/h in 4.9 seconds. The top SQ9 version uses a V8 with 591 hp and does 0-100 km/h in 3.8 seconds. A hybrid with a V6 and 48V electric motor is also available.\n\n📊@tech",
